## Weapons

### True duplicates

**What this shows.** Weapon copies identical to another copy of the same weapon, and any copy below Legendary, which isn't compared.

**How it was derived.** Copies below Legendary are flagged without comparing them. Among the rest, copies of one family whose element, frame (archetype) and every perk socket match are true duplicates: the copy with the highest gear tier, then the best wishlist score, then the oldest (lowest itemInstanceId) stays, and the others are listed.

**Reading it.** Each true duplicate names the copy kept in its place, which has the same roll.

