## Exotics

**What this shows.** For each class, how many of its exotic armor pieces you own, and each exotic with more than one copy, its copies in score order.

**How it was derived.** Copies of one exotic, matched by name ignoring case (so a reissue competes with the old version), keep their single best copy on the exotic's own stat picks; an exotic class item keeps one copy per perk pair. The score uses the copy's stats with masterwork, untuned: a Tier 5 exotic can tune any stat, so tuning doesn't tell its copies apart. Ties go to the older copy (lower itemInstanceId).

